# Top level (margin 60)
There should be no leading or trailing new lines
## finite
`foo`42`bar`

## omega
`foo`ω`bar`

## omega with coefficient and tail
`foo`3·ω
+ 7`bar`

## several summands
`foo`5·ω^3 + 4·ω^2 + 3·ω
+ 2`bar`

## many summands, wraps
`foo`111·ω^9 + 222·ω^8 + 333·ω^7 + 444·ω^6 + 555·ω^5
+ 666·ω^4
+ 777`bar`

## nested exponent
`foo`2·ω^(ω)
+ 1`bar`

# Nested mid-line
Summands should align to the column where the ordinal started, not to the enclosing box's own indentation
## finite
outer { ord = `foo`42`bar`;
      view = ... }

## omega
outer { ord = `foo`ω`bar`;
      view = ... }

## omega with coefficient and tail
outer { ord = `foo`3·ω
      + 7`bar`;
      view = ... }

## several summands
outer { ord = `foo`5·ω^3
      + 4·ω^2
      + 3·ω
      + 2`bar`;
      view = ... }

## many summands, wraps
outer { ord = `foo`111·ω^9
      + 222·ω^8
      + 333·ω^7
      + 444·ω^6
      + 555·ω^5
      + 666·ω^4
      + 777`bar`;
      view = ... }

## nested exponent
outer { ord = `foo`2·ω^(ω)
      + 1`bar`;
      view = ... }

